1
00:00:00,494 --> 00:00:02,284
(Leonard:)Here you go, Copenhagen boy.

2
00:00:02,455 --> 00:00:05,125
(Leonard:)How about a taste
of Hans Christian hand grenade?

3
00:00:05,291 --> 00:00:07,041
[EXPLOSION ON TV]

4
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,210
[MOUTHING]

5
00:00:09,378 --> 00:00:10,958
LEONARD:
That could not feel good.

6
00:00:13,299 --> 00:00:16,719
(Leonard:)Come on, come on. Oh, you clever...

7
00:00:19,972 --> 00:00:22,012
(Leonard:)Come on, come on.

8
00:00:22,475 --> 00:00:24,145
(Leonard:)Take that.

9
00:00:25,269 --> 00:00:27,269
Uh-oh.

10
00:00:28,606 --> 00:00:30,606
[SHOUTING]
Uh-oh.

11
00:00:30,816 --> 00:00:33,236
- What's the matter?
- This granola bar has peanuts in it.

12
00:00:33,402 --> 00:00:36,492
- Oh, my God. Why did you eat it?
- I don't know, it was just there.

13
00:00:36,656 --> 00:00:40,366
(Leonard:)Well, if I had a gun there,
would you have shot yourself?

14
00:00:40,534 --> 00:00:41,704
(Howard:)Don't yell at me.

15
00:00:41,869 --> 00:00:44,249
- I've gotta go to the emergency room.
- Now?

16
00:00:44,413 --> 00:00:47,503
(Howard:)No, after my tongue has swollen
to the size of a brisket.

17
00:00:48,125 --> 00:00:50,755
All right, just let me get my keys.

18
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:54,170
(Howard:)Oh, God, oh, God, oh, God...

19
00:00:54,340 --> 00:01:00,020
(Howard:)The laundry is out of the hamper.

